### 1) Get examination list
GET https://localhost:7081/api/luotkham?pageIndex=1&pageSize=10
Authorization: Bearer <token>

### 2) Get one encounter
GET https://localhost:7081/api/luotkham/1
Authorization: Bearer <token>

### 3) Complete encounter and create invoice if applicable
POST https://localhost:7081/api/luotkham/1/complete
Authorization: Bearer <token>
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### 4) Lock EMR
POST https://localhost:7081/api/luotkham/1/emr/lock
Authorization: Bearer <token>
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "lyDo": "Khám bệnh đã hoàn tất, cần khóa hồ sơ bệnh án",
  "chuKySo": "SIG_20260916_11_1"
}

### 5) Drug interaction check
POST https://localhost:7081/api/ai/drug-interaction-check
Authorization: Bearer <token>
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "patientId": 1001,
  "medicineIds": [101, 202, 303],
  "note": "Kiểm tra lại dị ứng thuốc"
}

### 6) Get role matrix
GET https://localhost:7081/api/admin/roles
Authorization: Bearer <token>

### 7) Save role matrix
POST https://localhost:7081/api/admin/roles
Authorization: Bearer <token>
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": 4,
  "code": "NURSE",
  "name": "Điều dưỡng",
  "description": "Theo dõi sinh hiệu và hỗ trợ khám",
  "dataScope": "DEPARTMENT_ONLY",
  "permissions": {
    "patient": ["VIEW"],
    "examination": ["VIEW", "CREATE"]
  }
}

### 8) Get EMR audit logs
GET https://localhost:7081/api/admin/audit-logs?patientId=1001&action=VIEW&pageIndex=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer <token>

### 9) Write EMR audit log
POST https://localhost:7081/api/admin/audit-logs
Authorization: Bearer <token>
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "patientId": 1001,
  "recordId": 9001,
  "userId": 11,
  "action": "PRESCRIBE",
  "module": "EMR",
  "ipAddress": "192.168.1.44",
  "details": "Bác sĩ kê đơn thuốc cho bệnh nhân",
  "status": "SUCCESS"
}

### 10) Get integration config
GET https://localhost:7081/api/admin/integration-config?category=LIS
Authorization: Bearer <token>

### 11) Upsert integration config
POST https://localhost:7081/api/admin/integration-config
Authorization: Bearer <token>
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "category": "LIS",
  "code": "HL7_PORT",
  "name": "Cổng HL7",
  "value": "2575",
  "description": "Cổng HL7 cho máy xét nghiệm",
  "isEncrypted": false
}
